{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01755","headline":"杂曲歌辞 车遥遥 · 胡曾","name":"杂曲歌辞 车遥遥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自从车马出门朝，便入空房守寂寥。\n玉枕夜残鱼信绝，金钿秋尽雁书遥。\n脸边楚雨临风落，头上春云向日销。\n芳草又衰还不至，碧天霜冷转无憀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}